---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer id="book" class="border-t border-neutral-200 bg-white">
  <div class="px-6 sm:px-12 py-20 sm:py-28">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center pb-16 border-b border-neutral-200">
      
      <!-- Left: Big Heading -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-neutral-900 tracking-tight leading-[1.1]">
          Sistemlerinizin büyümeye hazır olup olmadığını görün <br class="hidden sm:inline" />
          <span class="text-dj-italics text-neutral-600">(kesinlikle hazır)</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-base text-neutral-600 max-w-lg leading-relaxed pt-2">
          GHL otomasyonları ve yapay zekâ sistemleri hakkında 15 dakikalık hızlı bir tanışma ve mimari görüşmesi planlayın.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: Action Box -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5">
        <div class="rounded-3xl border border-neutral-200 bg-[#f9fafb] p-8 space-y-6 shadow-sm">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-2xl bg-black text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">
              15
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="text-sm font-bold text-neutral-900">15 Dakikalık Tanışma Görüşmesi</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-neutral-500 font-mono">Takvim üzerinden hemen seçin</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <a
            href="/contact"
            class="block w-full py-4 px-6 rounded-full bg-black text-white text-center font-bold text-xs hover:bg-neutral-800 transition-all shadow-md"
          >
            Görüşme Zamanı Belirle →
          </a>

          <div class="pt-2 text-center">
            <span class="text-xs text-neutral-500">Doğrudan e-posta yazmayı mı tercih edersiniz?</span> <br />
            <a href="mailto:iletisim@ercankurtoglu.site" class="text-xs font-bold text-neutral-900 underline hover:text-black mt-1 inline-block">
              iletisim@ercankurtoglu.site
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Bottom credits -->
    <div class="pt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between text-xs text-neutral-500 gap-4">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="font-extrabold text-neutral-900">Ercan Kurtoğlu</span>
        <span>•</span>
        <span>GoHighLevel & AI Architecture</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-6">
        <a href="https://github.com/ErcanKurtoglu" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-black transition-colors font-medium">GitHub</a>
        <a href="https://linkedin.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-black transition-colors font-medium">LinkedIn</a>
        <a href="https://x.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-black transition-colors font-medium">X (Twitter)</a>
        <span>© {year} Tüm hakları saklıdır.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
